  "article": {
    "images": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Hello, my name is Yuri and I come from Thailand. Trying new dishes is a good way to explore a new place. Here are some of the most popular foods in my country."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Pad Thai",
            "zh": "泰式炒粉"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Pad Thai is Thailand’s national dish. It can be found at most Thai restaurants and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "street stands",
            "zh": "货摊"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Thailand. It is made of rice noodles, vegetables, eggs and meat. When you are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "wandering",
            "ref": "v-wander"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " around the night markets, the local pad Thai stand is a great place to take a break. Enjoy the food and the sights of Thailand!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Mango sticky rice",
            "zh": "芒果糯米饭"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Mango is a popular fruit in Southeast Asia. The fruit can be used to make "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "a number of",
            "ref": "v-a-number-of"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " mouth-watering "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "desserts",
            "ref": "v-dessert"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". One example is mango sticky rice. The dessert is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "combination",
            "ref": "v-combination"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of sweet "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "ripe",
            "zh": "成熟的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " mango, sticky rice and coconut sauce. It gives people a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "refreshing",
            "ref": "v-refreshing"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " feeling during the summer heat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Papaya salad",
            "zh": "青木瓜沙拉"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A papaya salad has the four main "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "flavours",
            "ref": "v-flavour"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of Thai dishes—saltiness, sweetness, spiciness and sourness. When a customer orders a papaya salad, the cook will mix and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "crush",
            "ref": "v-crush"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " together papaya, tomatoes, chili, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "palm sugar",
            "zh": "椰糖"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", fish sauce and lime juice. Papaya salad tastes fresh and is one of the simplest Thai dishes."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
